      },
      "numberInSurah": 92,
      "juz": 10,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 201,
      "ruku": 167,
      "hizbQuarter": 80,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1328,
      "text": "Blame is only on those who ask you for exemption even though they are affluent. They are content to stay behind with the helpless[72], and Allah has sealed their hearts so they do not know.",
